      ],
      "rationale": "Intravenously infused letetresgene autoleucel (c259 TCR-T) recognizes HLA-A*02 / SLLMWITQC at positions 157-165 of LAGE-1a (ENST00000369585, 180 aa), achieves ~40% objective tumor responses across two sequential MRCLS cohorts (n=20 infused, JCO-24-01466 / NCT02992743), traverses the pulmonary capillary/alveolar bed on first pass, and shows zero attributed alveolar pneumonitis or cystitis. Explicitly excludes LAGE-1b (ENST00000247306, 210 aa, which lacks SLLMWITQC), heart (confounded day-161 cardiac arrest retained per #544), and brain (blood-brain barrier; brain snRNA-seq hold resolved separately by #711 Xq28 attribution)."
    },
